                      <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                      <format attr='background-color' value='#ebebeb' />
                    </zone-style>
                  </zone>
                </zone>
                <zone h='2778' id='8' type-v2='text' w='98828' x='586' y='6000'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run>A unified view of acquisition, engagement, and revenue across every channel.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='788' h='87556' id='9' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98828' x='586' y='8778'>
                  <zone fixed-size='1350' h='87556' id='10' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98828' x='586' y='8778' />
                </zone>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone fixed-size='1342' forceUpdate='true' h='89111' id='68' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='98097' x='878' y='8778'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>SaaS Product Intelligence Platform</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>USER GUIDE</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Welcome to the SaaS Product Intelligence Platform.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>This workbook provides an overview of customer information, subscription revenue, product engagement, and customer retention.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The dashboards are designed to help users understand customer behavior, monitor subscription performance, and identify trends across the SaaS business.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>DASHBOARD NAVIGATION</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>01. Customer Overview</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Provides an overview of the customer base, including customer distribution, industry, country, acquisition channel, and subscription status.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>02. Revenue Analytics</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Provides visibility into estimated recurring revenue, subscription plans, invoice amounts, and billing status.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>03. Product Engagement</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Shows how organizations and users interact with the product, including feature usage, identified activity, anonymous events, and user adoption.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>04. Customer Retention</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Provides an overview of customer retention, churn, subscription lifecycle, customer tenure, and cancellation reasons.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>HOW TO USE THIS WORKBOOK</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Select a dashboard to view the corresponding business metrics.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Use available filters to narrow down the information.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Select chart elements to explore specific customer segments.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Hover over charts and KPI cards to view additional details through tooltips.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Use the detail tables to review the underlying customer or subscription records.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Clear filters when you want to return to the full dataset.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true'>Note: Available filters and interactions may vary by dashboard.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>IMPORTANT METRIC DEFINITIONS</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Active Customer</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>An organization with at least one subscription without an end date.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Churned Customer</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>An organization with at least one subscription but no remaining active subscriptions.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Estimated MRR</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Estimated monthly recurring subscription run-rate based on plan price and seat price.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Estimated ARR</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Estimated MRR multiplied by 12.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>User Adoption Rate</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Percentage of identified organization users with at least one recorded usage event.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Activated User</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>An identified user with at least one attributed usage event.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Customer Retention Rate</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Percentage of retained customers among organizations that have subscribed.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>DATA INFORMATION</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Data Source:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> SQLShed SaaS Subscriptions practice dataset</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Data Platform:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> Microsoft SQL Server</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Visualization:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> Tableau Desktop</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Warehouse:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> Ejay_SaaS_Product_Intelligence</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The dataset contains six source tables covering plans, organizations, users, subscriptions, invoices, and usage events.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>DATA NOTES</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The dataset contains synthetic SaaS business records.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>MRR and ARR are estimated run-rate metrics, not recognized accounting revenue.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Product engagement metrics represent historical usage unless a reporting period is specified.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Anonymous usage events are included in organization-level engagement but excluded from identified user-level analytics.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Customer churn is based on subscription status, not product inactivity.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>PROJECT PURPOSE</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>This project demonstrates the development of a SaaS product analytics platform, covering data ingestion, SQL data modeling, metric definitions, data quality validation, and business intelligence reporting.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
